/div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32300,31816,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32300, 31816, 7)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Female</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Druid<br/>Druid Guild Leader</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5.1<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 23, 1999<br/>Beta 5.1</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20221211092711&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Padreia_92c09a.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Padreia.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a> Druid Guild on Magician's Alley\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Part of <a href=\"#/quest/the-exterminator-quest\">The Exterminator Quest</a>. Padreia is the grand <a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">druid</a> of <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a>. Like most Carlin NPCs, she is female. She will teach <a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">druids</a> all of her knowledge about spells. She is responsible not only for the guild but for the fields, and Carlin citizens health. She used to sell Fireball and <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Fireball\">Great Fireball</a> before the winter update 2007.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buys\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buys\">Buys</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">This NPC does not buy anything.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-sells\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sells\">Sells</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th></th><th>Item</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20of%20Cough%20Syrup\"><img alt=\"Flask of Cough Syrup\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flask_of_Cough_Syrup_802d66.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20of%20Cough%20Syrup\">Flask of Cough Syrup</a><sup>1</sup></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">50 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"item-notes\"><b>Notes:</b><ol><li id=\"w-notes-1\">By saying <i>(sell/buy) item name</i>.</li></ol></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Padreia.</i></dd></dl>\n<p><i>You see a sign.</i><br/>\n<i>You read: If you want to learn something about the</i><br/>\n<i>wonders of nature come and visit the sages</i><br/>\n<i>in our Druid Guild.<br/></i>\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: hi<br/>\nPadreia: Welcome to our humble guild, wanderer. May I be of any assistance to you?<br/>\nPlayer: job<br/>\nPadreia: I am the grand druid of Carlin. I am responsible for the guild, the fields, and our citizens' health.<br/>\nPlayer: magic<br/>\nPadreia: Every druid is able to learn the numerous spells of our craft.<br/>\nPlayer: spell<br/>\nPadreia: Sorry, I don't teach spells for your vocation.<br/>\nPlayer: name<br/>\nPadreia: I am Padreia, grand druid of our fine city.<br/>\nPlayer: time<br/>\nPadreia: Time is just a crystal pillar - the centre of creation and life.<br/>\nPlayer: druids<br/>\nPadreia: We are druids, preservers of life. Our magic is about defence, healing, and nature.<br/>\nPlayer: sorcerers<br/>\nPadreia: Sorcerers are destructive. Their power lies in destruction and pain.<br/>\nPlayer: bye<br/>\nPadreia: Farewell.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Padreia</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["the-ape-city-quest","the-exterminator-quest","the-paradox-tower-quest"],"pos":{"x":32300,"y":31816,"z":7}}